# Envelope extremes: attack 255, decay 0, sustain 0, release 0, release with pseudo-echo; start offset.
TRACK
VOLUME 110
PROGRAM 7
NOTE 24 c4 v100
WAIT 30
PROGRAM 8
ECHO_VOLUME 40
ECHO_LENGTH 12
NOTE 12 c4 v100
WAIT 40
ECHO_VOLUME 0
NOTE 12 d4 v100
WAIT 30
PROGRAM 1
NOTE 36 e4 v120
WAIT 60
START_OFFSET 500
NOTE 12 e4
WAIT 20
START_OFFSET 5000
NOTE 12 e4
WAIT 10
START_OFFSET 0
ATTACK 30
DECAY 240
SUSTAIN 60
RELEASE 250
NOTE 24 g4
WAIT 60
END
TRACK
VOLUME 100
PROGRAM 14
ECHO_VOLUME 128
ECHO_LENGTH 20
NOTE 24 c4 v127
WAIT 60
PROGRAM 15
NOTE 24 c4
WAIT 40
PROGRAM 12
NOTE 24 c4
WAIT 40
ECHO_VOLUME 0
PROGRAM 11
NOTE 96 c4
WAIT 96
END
